    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "Embark on a grand quest as Flame, an anthropomorphic dragon, as he leaves his home in the sky for the dangerous world below to find and rescue his girlfriend Crystal from the nefarious General Mechos in this modernized love-letter to classic action-adventure games from the NES and SNES!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJam-packed full of content, this game features 17 challenging levels, a total of 16 weapons (a mixture of spells and physical weapons), optional sidquests with varying rewards, a vast overworld between levels to explore, an experience and level-up system, and more! Defeat demons, conquer General Mechos' army, and discover your destiny in Heritage - A Dragon's Tale.",
    "about_the_game": "Embark on a grand quest as Flame, an anthropomorphic dragon, as he leaves his home in the sky for the dangerous world below to find and rescue his girlfriend Crystal from the nefarious General Mechos in this modernized love-letter to classic action-adventure games from the NES and SNES!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJam-packed full of content, this game features 17 challenging levels, a total of 16 weapons (a mixture of spells and physical weapons), optional sidquests with varying rewards, a vast overworld between levels to explore, an experience and level-up system, and more! Defeat demons, conquer General Mechos' army, and discover your destiny in Heritage - A Dragon's Tale.",
    "short_description": "Conquer 17 challenging levels in this 2D platformer adventure game, using a combination of spells, your sword, and other skills and abilities. Explore the overworld between levels, defeat demons, find secrets, and gain experience to make yourself stronger for the challenges ahead.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Slovak, Portuguese - Brazil",
